# The design workbench — mockups, the red fork, build scripts, sample data.
# It lives in the repo for reference, but Vercel serves whatever it uploads,
# and a half-finished fork of the calculator is not the site. Keep it out of
# the deployment. vercel.json also redirects /design/* as a guarantee.
design/

# Python leftovers from the design build scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Working material that is in the repo but is not the site. Vercel serves
# every uploaded file at its path, so without these lines /docs/seo-geo-plan.md,
# the content specs, the test suite and the SQL migrations were all public.
# data/ is NOT listed: the calculator fetches its JSON at runtime.
docs/
tools/
tests/
content/
supabase/
archive/
output/
tmp/
uk/
data/cache/
*.md
*.xlsx
*.docx
balco-product-concepts.html
